644">my </span><span begin="03:05.644" end="03:06.004">time </span><span begin="03:06.004" end="03:06.244">with </span><span begin="03:06.244" end="03:06.564">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.564" end="03:08.494"><span begin="03:06.564" end="03:06.814">So </span><span begin="03:06.814" end="03:07.134">hear </span><span begin="03:07.134" end="03:07.654">me </span><span begin="03:07.654" end="03:08.494">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.494" end="03:11.704"><span begin="03:08.494" end="03:08.724">I </span><span begin="03:08.724" end="03:08.944">won't </span><span begin="03:08.944" end="03:09.864">stay </span><span begin="03:09.864" end="03:10.054">(I </span><span begin="03:10.054" end="03:10.324">won't </span><span begin="03:10.324" end="03:11.704">stay)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.704" end="03:15.324"><span begin="03:11.704" end="03:11.904">It's </span><span begin="03:11.904" end="03:12.154">my </span><span begin="03:12.154" end="03:12.734">turn </span><span begin="03:12.734" end="03:13.044">to </span><span begin="03:13.044" end="03:13.754">walk </span><span begin="03:13.754" end="03:15.324">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.324" end="03:20.254"><span begin="03:15.324" end="03:15.534">Now </span><span begin="03:15.534" end="03:15.784">the </span><span begin="03:15.784" end="03:16.704">conversation's </span><span begin="03:16.704" end="03:18.064">over </span><span begin="03:18.064" end="03:18.304">(it's </span><span begin="03:18.304" end="03:19.174">over </span><span begin="03:19.174" end="03:20.254">yeah)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:20.254" end="03:25.224"><span begin="03:20.254" end="03:20.454">And </span><span begin="03:20.454" end="03:20.754">there's </span><span begin="03:20.754" end="03:21.144">nothing </span><span begin="03:21.144" end="03:21.594">more </span><span begin="03:21.594" end="03:21.994">to </span><span begin="03:21.994" end="03:22.894">say </span><span begin="03:22.894" end="03:23.104">(to </